# Laravel

- Prefer framework APIs: Form Requests, API Resources, Policies, Eloquent, Jobs/Events
- Thin controllers; put nontrivial writes in Actions
- Do not introduce repositories, DTO layers, or a command bus unless an ADR says so
- JSON API under `/api/v1`; keep Laravel validation error shape
- Never bake secrets into images or commit `.env`
